  "translation": "Mme a hodima altareng eo a eentseng Bethele, ka la bohlano le lesome letsatsing la kgwedi ya bo robeli, kgweding eo a e qapotseng ka pelong ya hae; mme a etsa mokete ho bana ba Yisraele, mme a hodima altareng ho nkela mofuthu.",
